SUMMARY:Doctoral Defence: Maarit Olkkola — Essays on Health Policy and Hu
 man Capital
DESCRIPTION:Series: Aalto University\nType: Doctoral Defence\nSpeaker: Maar
 it Olkkola (Aalto University)\nTitle: Essays on Health Policy and Human Ca
 pital\nOpponent: Prof. Miriam Wüst\, University of Copenhagen\, Denmark\n
 Custos: Prof. Matti Sarvimäki\, Aalto University School of Business\, Dep
 artment of Economics\n\nMaarit Olkkola’s dissertation demonstrates that 
 the evaluation of public policies targeting children should also consider 
 potential long-term benefits\, such as human capital formation. The disser
 tation consists of three essays\, two of which focus on the introduction o
 f a network of child health centers in Finland.\n\nTime not published yet 
 — all-day placeholder.\n\nDefence announcement: https://www.aalto.fi/en/
 events/public-defence-in-economics-msocsc-maarit-olkkola\nEvent page: http
 s://www.helsinkigse.fi/events/maarit-olkkola-defence
URL:https://www.helsinkigse.fi/events/maarit-olkkola-defence
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
