  Pharmaceutical Markets\nOpponent: Prof. Anders Munk-Nielsen\, University 
 of Copenhagen\, Denmark\nCustos: Prof. Otto Toivanen\, Aalto University Sc
 hool of Business\, Department of Economics\n\nThe dissertation examines th
 e effects of pharmaceutical market regulation on market outcomes in Finlan
 d and in the Nordic countries.\n\nTime not published yet — all-day place
 holder.\n\nArticle on the thesis: https://www.helsinkigse.fi/articles/indu
 strial-organization-studies-on-pharmaceutical-markets\nDefence announcemen
 t: https://www.aalto.fi/en/events/public-defence-in-economics-msc-econ-jaa
