SUMMARY:Doctoral Defence: Amin Mohazab Rahimzadeh — Essays on Blockchain 
 Technology and Digital Economics
DESCRIPTION:Series: Aalto University\nType: Doctoral Defence\nSpeaker: Amin
  Mohazab Rahimzadeh (Aalto University)\nTitle: Essays on Blockchain Techno
 logy and Digital Economics\nOpponent: Doctor Saara Hämäläinen\, Univers
 ity of Helsinki\nCustos: Professor Otto Toivanen\, Aalto University School
  of Business\, Department of Economics\n\nBitcoin Payment System is the fi
 rst and the most prominent decentralized protocol to send monetary transac
 tions worldwide. In other words\, it guarantees secure payments without th
 e need for any regulation framework. However\, it suffers from the problem
  of scalability since it is only capable of sending 7-10 transactions per 
 second.\n\nTime not published yet — all-day placeholder.\n\nDefence anno
 uncement: https://www.aalto.fi/en/events/public-defence-in-economics-mba-a
 min-mohazab-rahimzadeh\nEvent page: https://www.helsinkigse.fi/events/amin
 -mohazab-rahimzadeh-defence
URL:https://www.helsinkigse.fi/events/amin-mohazab-rahimzadeh-defence
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
