SUMMARY:Doctoral Defence: Arttu Ahonen — Essays on climate policy and tra
 nsportation
DESCRIPTION:Series: Aalto University\nType: Doctoral Defence\nSpeaker: Artt
 u Ahonen (Aalto University)\nTitle: Essays on climate policy and transport
 ation\nOpponent: Prof. Moritz Drupp\, ETH Zurich / University of Hamburg\n
 Custos: Prof. Matti Liski\, Aalto University School of Business\, Departme
 nt of Economics\n\nRoad transportation is a major source of global carbon 
 dioxide emissions\, and a particularly difficult-to-abate sector\, requiri
 ng a mass of individual consumers to invest in cleaner technologies or red
 uce their kilometers driven.\n\nTime not published yet — all-day placeho
 lder.\n\nDefence announcement: https://www.aalto.fi/en/events/public-defen
