SUMMARY:Doctoral Defence: Marika Viertola — Essays on corporate income ta
 xation and multinational enterprises
DESCRIPTION:Series: Aalto University\nType: Doctoral Defence\nSpeaker: Mari
 ka Viertola (Aalto University)\nTitle: Essays on corporate income taxation
  and multinational enterprises\nOpponent: Prof. İrem Güçeri\, Universit
 y of Oxford\nCustos: Prof. Tuukka Saarimaa\, Aalto University School of Bu
 siness\, Department of Economics\n\nTaxation influences corporate activity
  and decision-making in many ways\, and these behavioral responses impact 
 the efficiency of the tax system. Multinational enterprises with operation
 s in several countries may react to differences in tax rates and regulatio
 n by allocating their activities and profits across jurisdictions.\n\nTime
  not published yet — all-day placeholder.\n\nDefence announcement: https
 ://www.aalto.fi/en/events/public-defence-in-economics-msc-econ-marika-vier
 tola\nEvent page: https://www.helsinkigse.fi/events/marika-viertola-defenc
 e
URL:https://www.helsinkigse.fi/events/marika-viertola-defence
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
